        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Globs of smoldering brimstone erupt from the earth, dealing 8d6 fire damage to each creature in the area with a basic Reflex save and choking them with sulfurous fumes. For the duration, the area is difficult terrain, and breathing creatures that start their turn in the area must succeed at a Fortitude save or take @Damage[(@item.level - 3)d6[persistent,poison]] damage; this is an inhaled poison effect. On a critical failure, they're also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1}. You can Dismiss the spell.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The fire damage increases by 1d6, and the persistent poison damage increases by 1d6.</p>"
